    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "3. Appellant is seeking for being enlarged on anticipatory bail apprehending his arrest in FIR No.250/2024 registered for the offences punishable under Sections 406, 420, 467, 468, 471 and 120-B of the Indian Penal Code, 1860.",
